A key to what the marks mean. A continuous colour bar, because the fill comes from
a sequential scale - or, when the bubbles are on, the radius legend they need
instead, which is what the component and offset scalars are for.

// #label Legend
// #hint A key to the shades, or to the circle sizes when bubbles are on.

// #region magicNumbers
/** Gap in px between the bottom of the map and the legend. */
const LEGEND_GUTTER = 60;
// #endregion

// #scalar BOTTOM_PADDING 90

// #region components
const legend = __LEGEND_COMPONENT__;
// #endregion

// #region render
chartLayer
  .selectGroup("legend")
  .attr(
    "transform",
    sszvis.translateString(__LEGEND_X__, bounds.innerHeight + LEGEND_GUTTER),
  )
  .call(legend);
// #endregion
